    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d388-f1" n="1" xml:id="d388-f1-content">
                <p>Chronological collection of the records of the Secretary of State’s daily
                    meetings with top Department of State officials for the years 1949–1952, as
                    maintained by the Special Assistant to the Secretary of State.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d388-f2" n="2" xml:id="d388-f2-content">
                <p>The omitted sections summarized discussions of the Korean situation and Iran.</p>
            </note>
